2 CONC the Syrian City-State from Earliest Times until Its Fall to the Assyrians in 732 B.C.E.. Eisenbrauns. p. 91. 4.^ Stephen W. Holloway (1997). "Assyria and Babylonia in the Tenth Century". In Lowell K. Handy. The Age of Solomon: Sch
