2 CONC oyal Inscriptions. 2. Wiesbaden: Otto Harrassowitz. Mallowan, M.E. L. (1966). Nimrud and Its Remains. London: Collins. Reade, J.E. (1979/1980). "Assyrian Architectural Decoration". Baghdader Mitteilungen 10/11: 71–87. Stearns, J. 
2 CONC B. (1961). Reliefs from the Palace of Ashurnasirpal II. Graz: Ernst F. Weidner. [edit] External linksAshurnasirpal II - Archaeowiki.org Human-headed winged lion (lamassu) Entry at Questia Online Library
