2 CONC in "Chapter 3: Assyrian & Hittite Synchronisms" The Genealogy of Ashakhet; 4.^ Ancient Near Eastern History and Culture by William H. Stiebing Jr. Preceded by Shamshi-Adad V King of Assyria 811–783 BC Succeeded by Shalmaneser IV P
