1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''
2 CONT =Sura of Parthia=
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Sura of Parthia was a heroine of the Parthian Empire who was the daughter of Ardavān V, the last king of the Parthian Empire. Sura had the rank of Sepahbod (Lieutenant General). She is considered by Iranians as a military genius w
2 CONC hose role model was another female Parthian general named Surena. Sura's main tactic was to not charge into the enemy line before weakening and exhausting them first. Sura had a grudge against King Ardashir I because on 225 A.D. A
2 CONC rdeshir (Son of Pāpak) went to a great war against her father (Ardavān V) and killed him in battle. Ardashir I restored the central power in Persia and completely changed the feudalistic system of (Ashkanid Parthians). He set Zoro
2 CONC astrianism as the official religion of Persia. His move paved the way for future rulers to use Zoroastrianism as the base of their actions and established a very strong monarchy based on the Achaemenid's 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source : '''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sura_of_Parthia
