2 CONT '''Lucius Julius Aurelius Septimius Vaballathus Athenodorus''' (Palmyrene: Whblt.png; Arabic: '''وَهْبُ اللَّات‎''' '''Wahb Allāt''') c. 259 – c. 274 AD) was emperor of the Palmyrene Empire centred at Palmyra in the region of Syri
2 CONC a. He came to power as a child under his regent mother Zenobia, who led a revolt against the Roman Empire and formed the independent Palmyrene Empire.
