2 CONT     [140] Zosso and Zingg (1995), p. 192.
2 CONT     [141] Iordanes Getarum, MGH Auct. ant. V.1, p. 118.
2 CONT     [142] Zosso and Zingg (1995), p. 192.
2 CONT     [143] Zosso and Zingg (1995), p. 192.
