1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Prince Juansher II (Georgian: ჯუანშერ II) was a Georgian prince of royal Chosroid dynasty. Prince of Kakheti in 786-807.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a son of Prince Archil of Kakheti. Juansher II married in 790 Princess Latavri of Tao-Klarjeti, daughter of Adarnase I of Tao-Klarjeti.
2 CONT
2 CONT The couple remained childless after the death of Juansher in 807. Juansher received the title of Prince of Iberia which was recognized by his brother-in-law Ashot I of Iberia.
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife remarried Javanshir's counselor and army commander Babak Khorrami https://www.geni.com/people/Babak-Khorrami/6000000127627704949
