1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Prince Ioane (Georgian: იოანე) was a Georgian prince of royal Chosroid dynasty. Prince of Kakheti in 786-790, co-ruled with his younger brother Juansher of Kakheti.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a son of Prince Archil of Kakheti. Fleeing Arabs, Ioane retired in western Georgia accompanied by his mother and two sisters (. Ioane died around 790 leaving no descendants.
2 CONT
2 CONT Upon Archil’s death, Iovane evacuated to Egrisi
