2 CONT 4.         '''RITA''' (-[1210]).  The Chronique du Royaume de la Petite Arménie of Constable Sempad records that names "fille de Sempad, seigneur de Babaron et sœur de Pagouran…Ritha" as wife of "Sdephanê"[947].  She succeeded in 
2 CONC 1205 as Lady of Lampron.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ( [1143/44] ) STEPANE, son of LEWON I Lord of the Mountains [Rupen] & his wife Béatrice de Rethel (before 1110-murdered 7 Feb 1165, bur Arkagaghine). 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
