2 CONC 128 5.^ Bryer 6.^ a b Bryer (1975), p. 148 7.^ a b Bryer (1975), p. 148, fn. 141 [edit] Sources Bryer, Anthony (1975). "Greeks and Turkmens: The Pontic Exception". Dumbarton Oaks Papers (Dumbarton Oaks) 29: 113–148. http://www.tc.
2 CONC umn.edu/~cmedst/gmap/uploaded/Greeks%20and%20Turkmens%20The%20Pontic%20Exception.pdf.
