2 CONT 5.         MARIA Megala Komnene .  Her parentage and marriage are confirmed by the Chronicle of Michael Panaretos which records that "the emperor´s son-in-law from Limnia the emir Taceddin" set out 24 Oct 1386 "against the emperor
2 CONC ´s other son-in-law, the son of Chatzymeris from Chalybia, Suleiman Beg" but was killed in battle in "Chalybia"[137].  The primary source which confirms her name has not yet been identified.   
