2 CONT (a)       daughter .  Kuršankis states that “Muhammed Juki, fils de Shahrukh” assembled the chiefs of the White Sheep at Erzerum in autumn 1435 to decide the division of territories of Kara Yülük after his death and married “Khanu
2 CONC m” on of Kara Yülük´s daughters[1069].  
