1 NAME Giorgio /Cornaro/ procurator di S.Marco
2 GIVN Giorgio
2 SURN Cornaro
2 NSFX procurator di S.Marco
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 25 NOV 1454
2 ADDR
3 CITY Venezia
3 STAE Veneto
3 CTRY Italia
1 DEAT
2 DATE 31 JUL 1527
2 ADDR
3 CITY Venezia
3 STAE Veneto
3 CTRY Italia
1 TITL conte
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} - http://www.treccani.it/enciclopedia/giorgio-corner_(Dizionario-Biografico)/
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://www.rikvanhauwe.be/Venice/BO/B.O.III.C.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Corner x Morosini anno 1475 ( Giorgio eques di Marco eques x Elisabetta fu Francesco qu Giacomo )    Carta 33
2 CONT
2 CONT He is brother-in-law of Battista Morosini qu Carlo , they married Morosini - sisters
2 CONT
2 CONT Giorgio Corner di Marco became Procurator San Marco instead of Domenico Morosini , on 21.03.1509
2 CONT He is brother of Queen of Cyprus
2 CONT
2 CONT He + 31.07.1527 , buried in Ss. Apostoli
2 CONT
2 CONT no probation , born anno 1482 : Marco
2 CONT       1) Marco became cardinal anno 1500 for the sum of 15000 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT        He + 26.07.1524 aged 42 years , he was bishop of Padua  & Verona , patriarch of Constantinopel , abbot of several rich abbeys see the list of his income in Sanudo XXXV . 492
2 CONT
2 CONT        He had an income of 20.000 ducats , the greatest income of all  the Venetian cardinals
2 CONT
2 CONT        4 of his nephews will become abbot of one of the vacant functions 
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1496 : Francesco ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Vettore Soranzo qu Giovanni & Filippo Querini qu Giovanni )
2 CONT     2) He is at election for 2 ambassadors to Count Pitigliano on 01.04.1504 , not elected
2 CONT         He is in Dignano in Friuli together with Alvise Soranzo qu Vettore & Pietro Marcello qu Vettore , see 12.01.1502 in Sanuo IV . 610
2 CONT         He is one of the defenders of Padua , list on 09.09.1509 , is on guard at the piazza
2 CONT         He is sopracomito on 13.03.1510 for loan of 1500 ducats , see Sanudo X / 31
2 CONT         He is sopracomito in the armada on 01.09.1510
2 CONT         He goes to defend Padua on 07.10.1513 and joins Girolamo Contarini , the proveditor
2 CONT         He is sent to the defense of Padua on 13.11.1514 amidst the 12 defenders , Sanudo XIX . 236
2 CONT         He is elected consiglieri San Marco on 13.04.1516 pro ducati 3000
2 CONT         He is in zonta Senate on 03.10.1518
2 CONT         He is ambassador in Spain , writes from Barcelona on 18.02.1518
2 CONT         He is in zonta Senate on 01.10.1519
2 CONT         Francesco el cavalier di Giorgio el Cavalier Procurator is ambassador at the court of the emperor Charles Habsburg , he writes a report from Gent on 10.06.1520 which Sanudo published on 01.07.1520
2 CONT         He is in zonta Senate on 01.10.1521 , é ambassador
2 CONT         He is on XLV and the XI at election of Antonio Grimani on 30.06.1521
2 CONT         He is in zonta Senate on 01.10.1521
2 CONT         Francesco is elected Procurator San Marco on 27.03.1522 for a total of 20.000 ducats , see Sanudo XXXIII pagina 96 , the new Procurator is 46 years old
2 CONT         He is elected proveditor Arsenale on 09.02.1523 together with Francesco Dona eques qu Alvise
2 CONT         He is at funeral of his father on 02.08.1527
2 CONT         He became a cardinal on 16.02.1527 , see Sanudo XLVI pagina 615
2 CONT
2 CONT        The new cardinal is 50 years old
2 CONT
2 CONT         See the list on 06.06.1528 after mass in San Marco and the banquet in Sanudo XLVIII pagina 45
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1503 : Giacomo ( sponsors are Nicolo Dolfin qu Marco & Pietro Zen di Catarino equitis instead of the father who is podesta in Padua , tt. are Alvise Marcello qu Giacomo & Carolo Valier qu Girolamo )  
2 CONT     3) Giacomo di Giorgio is member of the compagnia named ' Fausti ' , see Sanudo IV. on 19.02.1502
2 CONT         Giacomo is luogotenente patria del Fruili on 09.08.1516 , see election on 07.10.1515
2 CONT         Giacomo was elected pro ducati on 07.10.1515 as luogotenente Friuli , he had already invested 2700 ducats and would now pay a further 3300 ducats , see Sanudo XXI . 211
2 CONT         He had not yet paid any ducats on 01.05.1516 so a vice-luogotenente is elected , see Sanudo XXII pagina 184
2 CONT         He failed at election for the zonta on 03.04.1519 , this was the 22th time he failed at election for the zonta , much be a record-attempt
2 CONT         He is in zonta Senate elected on 18.12..1519 , see Sanudo XXVIII pagina 123 , in the end he got elected at last
2 CONT         Giacomo is on the XLV in the election of Andrea Gritti anno 1523
2 CONT         Giacomo di Giorgio is member of Dieci on 09.09.1526 per ducati 1500
2 CONT         He is capo X on 01.10.1526 & 01.06.1527
2 CONT         He is elected capitano Verona instead of the deceased Daniele Barbaro on 02.06.1528 , fo capo X ,  see Sanudo XLVIII
2 CONT         He enters the X nuovo on 09.01.1530 instead of Nicolo Bernardo
2 CONT         He is Procurator San Marco on 14.06.1537 for sum of 16.000 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT       Corner x Morosini anno 1509 ( Giacomo fu Giorgio x Marina fu Orsato fu Francesco )     
2 CONT
2 CONT       Sanudo VIII . 35 on 25.03.1509, wedding in Ca Nani in San Trovaso  . The bride is a rich heiress , " da tutti desiderata "
2 CONT
2 CONT       Their son Giorgio died in november 1521 , see Sanudo XXXII . 208              
2 CONT
2 CONT           Estimo 1514 . San Maurizio . 14 . Marina consorte Giacomo di Giorgio el cavalier Procurator . Her estimo is 607 ducats  **
2 CONT
2 CONT           ** Marina is a rich heiress , her casa stazio in Ss. Apostoli is rented by Nadalino Contarini for 45 ducats a year , she owns other houses all around Venice and mills and farmhouses on the terraferma
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1513 : Giovanni ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Venerio de Salis doctor juris & Raphael Penzino scribe )
2 CONT     3) Giovanni di Giorgio cavalier Procurator is in Padua on 01.11.1513 with additional 25 men , see his father who is consiglieri ducale
2 CONT          Giovanni entered Great Council on 23.08.1514 after payment of 100 carats
2 CONT          He joins his father who goes to meet the French king in Milano on 07.11.1515
2 CONT          He is senator per ducati on 06.08.1516
2 CONT          He is podesta & capitano Rovigo on 13.11.1518
2 CONT          He is member of the Immortali on 11.09.1519
2 CONT          He is patronus of a galley with pilgrims anno 1520 , see Sanudo on 07.07.1520
2 CONT          He is senator on 08.11.1521 per ducati 400 for period of 4 years , see Sanudo XXXII pagina 112
2 CONT          He is at election for exatori imprestidi on 04.05.1527
2 CONT          He is at funeral of his father on 02.08.1527
2 CONT
2 CONT        Giovanni di Giorgio cavalier Procurator x Andriana Pisani di Alvise Procurator a bancho , marriage on 06.10.1516 a la Croce di la Giudecca  , see Sanudo XXIII . 28
2 CONT
2 CONT no probation : Girolamo
2 CONT
2 CONT     4) Girolamo entered Great Council on 30.10.1517 aged XXV , sponsor is the father who testifies his mother is Elisabetha Morosini , tt. are Giorgio Pisani doctor eques qu Domenico doctor. & Giacomo Contarini qu Pietro
2 CONT
2 CONT         Girolamo married a rich heiress in Candia anno 1511 , see Sanudo XXV . 37 , she is a rich Muaza who is a niece of the Calergi and one of the richest people in Candia
2 CONT
2 CONT         He is elected capitano Candia on 23.06.1526 for the sum of 7000 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT         Nota bene :  Girolamo lived in Cyprus when Giorgio died
2 CONT
2 CONT Nota , Sanudo XXIII . 362 mentions the daughters of Giorgio Corner who were married , he sums up his son-in-laws
2 CONT
2 CONT Giorgio Corner Procurator + 31.07.1527 , he was 74 years old and compagno di calza dil Serenissimo
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Mocenigo  , Pietro qu Francesco , fo capo X ( avogador piccoli in 1496 )   She is widow of Giovanni Soranzo qu Vettore & Filippo Sanudo qu Pietro
2 CONT 2) Trevisan , Pietro di Domenico Procurator
2 CONT 3) Contarini , Giacomo qu Pietro x Lugrezia di Giorgio
2 CONT 4) Malipiero , Giovanni Antonio qu Nicolo x Bianca vedova Vincenzo Priuli qu Giovanni Francesco
2 CONT 5) Loredan , Giovanni Francesco qu Marco Antonio
2 CONT
2 CONT 6) a natural daughter x Giovanni Foscarini di Nicolo , see also Sanudo VI. 153 , anno 1516 in Sanudo XXIII called Giovanni Foscarini qu  Nicolo
2 CONT
2 CONT Nota bene : Andrea who is natural son of Giorgio Procurator becomes bishop of Cherso - Oderzo on 14.12.1512 , see Sanudo XIII . 317
2 CONT
2 CONT Family-members at funeral of Procurator Giorgio Corner are ( Sanudo XLV pagina 576 )
2 CONT
2 CONT Francesco Corner , his son
2 CONT Giacomo Corner , his son
2 CONT Giovanni Corner , his son
2 CONT Mocenigo , Pietro , son-in-law
2 CONT Trevisan , Pietro , son-in-law
2 CONT Contarini , Giacomo , son-in-law
2 CONT Malipiero , Giovanni Antonio , son-in-law
2 CONT Loredan , Giovanni Francesco qu Marco Antonio , son-in-law
2 CONT Soranzo , Pietro , grandson
2 CONT Dandolo , Marco doctor cavalier , was his brother-in-law
2 CONT Priuli , Nicolo qu Domenico , his nephew
2 CONT
2 CONT Absent are
2 CONT
2 CONT Lando , Marco , his nepote
2 CONT Capello , Filippo , his nepote
2 CONT Morosini , Taddeo qu Francesco , his brother-in-law
