2 CONC rother Tahmasp I (ref. page 17 de "Tazkare Tahmasb" http://up.bookmaker.ir/download/1189538/tazkare-tahmasb.pdf )
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT  When Tahmasp's brother Bahram Mirza Safavi died in 1549, he took care of the latter's children, even announcing prince Badi-al Zaman Mirza Safavi as his own son. He thereafter made him the governor of Sistan, and offered him Pari
2 CONC  Khan Khanum (who was at that time 10 years old) as a wife, which he accepted. However, since she was Tahmasp's favored daughter, she was not allowed to go alongside her husband to Sistan
