2 CONT '''Marguerite d'Angoulême '''
2 CONT F, #103081, '''b. 11 April 1492, d. 21 December 1549'''
2 CONT Last Edited=29 Jul 2009
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=3.13%
2 CONT '''     Marguerite d'Angoulême was born on 11 April 1492. She was the daughter of '''Charles d'Orléans, Comte d'Angoulême and Luisa Principessa di Savoia-Piedmonte. '''She married, firstly, Charles IV d'Alençon, Duc d'Alençon in 1
2 CONC 509.3 She married, secondly, Enrique II, Rey de Navarre''', son of Juan III, Rey de Navarre and Catherine, Reina de Navarre, '''on 24 January 1526. She died on 21 December 1549 at age 57.'''
2 CONT '''     After her marriage, Marguerite d'Angoulême was styled as Reine Marguerite de Navarre.'''
2 CONT '''Child of Marguerite d'Angoulême and Enrique II, Rey de Navarre'''
2 CONT 1. Jeanne III, Reina de Navarre+3 b. 7 Jan 1528, d. 9 Jun 1572
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT 1.[S130] Wikipedia, online http;//www.wikipedia.org. Hereinafter cited as Wikipedia.
2 CONT 2.[S3409] Caroline Maubois, "re: Penancoet Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 2 December 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Penancoet Family."
