1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Capt. Rodrigo FLORES de Valdes [422],[872],[955],[1608],[1655] was also known as ______ Flores or Valle (OVALLE). 
2 CONT *He was originally from Villa Cangas, in the Concejo de Tineo, Asturias, Spain.
2 CONT
2 CONT -- MERGED NOTE <nowiki>------------</nowiki>
2 CONT
2 CONT Ana de Valle and Juan Flores were siblings, but I do not know whether their father was a Flores and their mother a Valle, or vice versa. 
2 CONT *Parents: Juan FLORES and Alfonsa CARBALLO.
2 CONT *Spouse: Maria Isabel de Trevino SALAZAR (aka Maria de Treviño). Maria Isabel de Trevino SALAZAR (aka Maria de Treviño) and Capt. Rodrigo FLORES de Valdes were married in 1612.[872]  Children were: 
2 CONT **1. Alferez Rodrigo FLORES de Valdes, 
2 CONT **2. Isabel FLORES de VALDES, 
